      "content": "i know people say that but it feels so selfish to keep trying when i know i'm just broken. it feels like i'm just a ticking time bomb for everyone else's happiness. if i'm gone, the pattern dies. no more drinking, no more yelling, no more damage. isn't it more logical to just end the struggle before i end up hurting them the way my dad hurt me?",
